  "term": "surgency",
  "definition": "Surgency is a temperament dimension, also described as surgency/extraversion, involving strong positive reactivity to stimulation. It refers to a tendency to become easily excited and active, seek novelty and excitement, and show high activity and impulsive behavior in response to the environment.",
